// Something a build does, as compiling: kiln compile runs the task named compile, after those it
// depends on, each once. A task part of another runs before it, as if that depended on it: a
// plugin's task part of Check, as a test is, runs when check does, and so when build does.
type Task(name: TaskName, description: String, dependsOn: List<TaskName> = [], partOf: List<TaskName> = [], action: @Building (Invocation) -> Unit)
